    "title": "Holy Dormition Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra. Millennium photography",
    "subtitle": "documentary project of \"Inter\" TV channel",
    "lead": "<p>The Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra is the first monastery in Kyiv Rus', founded by St. Anthony after he returned from Mount Athos and brought the Athos tradition of monastic life to our land. From that moment, a thousand years ago, the history of all monasticism in Kyiv Rus' began.</p>",
    "body": "The documentary project of the Inter TV channel will tell about the thousand-year history of <a href=\"https://inok.info/monasteries/242/?lang=en\">the Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra</a>, about the fate of the monastery in the 20th century, in the era of the most severe trials, and about its revival after the restoration of monastic service here. <h2>Photo gallery</h2> <div class=\"gallery\"> <a href=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/00.jpg\"> <img src=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/small/00t1q80w150.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Holy Dormition Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra. Millennium photography (documentary project of &quot;Inter&quot; TV channel) (+Video)\"> </a> <a href=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/02.jpg\"> <img src=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/small/02t1q80w150.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Holy Dormition Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra. Millennium photography (documentary project of &quot;Inter&quot; TV channel) (+Video)\"> </a> <a href=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/03.jpg\"> <img src=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/small/03t1q80w150.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Holy Dormition Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra. Millennium photography (documentary project of &quot;Inter&quot; TV channel) (+Video)\"> </a> <a href=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/04.jpg\"> <img src=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/small/04t1q80w150.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Holy Dormition Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra. Millennium photography (documentary project of &quot;Inter&quot; TV channel) (+Video)\"> </a> <a href=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/05.jpg\"> <img src=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/small/05t1q80w150.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"Holy Dormition Kyiv-Pechersk Lavra. Millennium photography (documentary project of &quot;Inter&quot; TV channel) (+Video)\"> </a> <a href=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/06.jpg\"> <img src=\"https://inok.info/images/articles/1682/sma