    "id": 1892,
    "kind": "video",
    "title": "Herman. The Story of a Monk",
    "subtitle": "a film by Ilmir Mukhametov",
    "lead": "<p>Amid the harsh northern landscape, the winter silence and the strict order of monastic life unfolds the path of a man who has chosen prayer, obedience and inner work on himself. Herman goes through doubts, weariness, spiritual questions and moments of quiet joy, gradually discovering for himself the depth of the monastic path. The film breaks down familiar stereotypes about monasticism and shows, behind the monastic habit, a living person — with feelings, weaknesses, inner struggles and sincere faith. It is a contemplative story about choice, spiritual coming of age and the search for inner support on an island where nature, silence and faith become part of a single path.</p>",
